parameters.text:
=You are an executive job engine assistant evaluating an incoming email from the candidate's personal inbox.

INCOMING EMAIL DETAILS:
From: {{ $json.from }}
Subject: {{ $json.subject }}
Body Snippet: {{ $json.text }}

Determine if this email is a positive interaction regarding a job opportunity (e.g., recruiter reaching out, interview scheduling request, coffee chat invite, or application follow-up).

Return strictly raw JSON (no markdown wrapping):
{
  "isPositiveOpportunity": true | false,
  "companyName": "<Extracted Company Name or Unknown>",
  "summary": "<1-sentence summary of what the sender is asking/offering>",
  "urgency": "High" | "Medium" | "Low"
}

parameters.jsCode:
for (const item of $input.all()) {
  // Grab raw text output from Gemini
  const rawText = item.json.text || item.json.output || '';

  // Clean markdown fences (```json) if present
  const cleanedText = rawText.replace(/```json/gi, '').replace(/```/g, '').trim();

  try {
    const parsed = JSON.parse(cleanedText);
    item.json.isPositiveOpportunity = parsed.isPositiveOpportunity ?? false;
    item.json.companyName = parsed.companyName || 'Unknown';
    item.json.summary = parsed.summary || '';
    item.json.urgency = parsed.urgency || 'Low';
  } catch (e) {
    // Safety fallback if email parsing fails
    item.json.isPositiveOpportunity = false;
    item.json.companyName = 'Unknown';
    item.json.summary = 'Failed to parse email intent.';
    item.json.urgency = 'Low';
  }
}

return $input.all();

